[{"text": "The assembly will now hear an address by", "start": 0.48, "duration": 10.32}, {"text": "his majesty Abdullah II al Hussein, king", "start": 4.72, "duration": 10.079}, {"text": "of the Hashimite Kingdom of Jordan.", "start": 10.8, "duration": 7.68}, {"text": "I request protocol to escort his majesty", "start": 14.799, "duration": 8.761}, {"text": "and invite him to address the assembly.", "start": 18.48, "duration": 5.08}, {"text": "Rahman Rahim,", "start": 48.0, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "Mr. President, Mr. Secretary General,", "start": 50.32, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "your excellencies,", "start": 52.64, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "every generation believes the challenges", "start": 55.52, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "they face are unmatched.", "start": 58.0, "duration": 7.199}, {"text": "Perhaps for us that is true.", "start": 61.84, "duration": 7.04}, {"text": "We are at a unique moment in history.", "start": 65.199, "duration": 6.401}, {"text": "The scale of knowledge and the speed of", "start": 68.88, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "change are unprecedented.", "start": 71.6, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "Every day brings another crisis, another", "start": 75.52, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "tragedy, another emergency", "start": 78.0, "duration": 7.119}, {"text": "demanding our attention.", "start": 81.28, "duration": 6.159}, {"text": "One study shows that average screen", "start": 85.119, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "attention has fallen from 2.5 minutes in", "start": 87.439, "duration": 5.281}, {"text": "2004", "start": 91.119, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "to just 47 seconds today.", "start": 92.72, "duration": 7.68}, {"text": "Of course, a screen is not the world,", "start": 97.119, "duration": 6.481}, {"text": "but that says something about our world", "start": 100.4, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "today.", "start": 103.6, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "that attention has become a scarce asset", "start": 105.52, "duration": 6.639}, {"text": "and where we choose to direct it has", "start": 108.88, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "never mattered more.", "start": 112.159, "duration": 5.521}, {"text": "And in this chamber,", "start": 115.04, "duration": 5.439}, {"text": "attention is more than a cognitive", "start": 117.68, "duration": 4.799}, {"text": "resource.", "start": 120.479, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "It is a geopolitical one.", "start": 122.479, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "It determines which conflicts receive", "start": 126.079, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "sustained diplomacy", "start": 128.879, "duration": 6.321}, {"text": "and which fade from the agenda.", "start": 130.879, "duration": 6.401}, {"text": "Whether a ceasefire holds after the", "start": 135.2, "duration": 5.119}, {"text": "cameras leave, whether humanitarian", "start": 137.28, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "suffering remains intolerable", "start": 140.319, "duration": 7.361}, {"text": "or becomes familiar,", "start": 144.16, "duration": 6.96}, {"text": "and whether the world steps up or", "start": 147.68, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "scrolls", "start": 151.12, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "and strolls away,", "start": 152.64, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "history rarely catches us entirely by", "start": 155.92, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "surprise.", "start": 158.56, "duration": 5.679}, {"text": "More often it catches us focused", "start": 160.64, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "elsewhere.", "start": 164.239, "duration": 5.121}, {"text": "Economic disparity, food insecurity,", "start": 166.72, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "climate change disasters.", "start": 169.36, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "None of these challenged emerged", "start": 172.0, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "overnight.", "start": 174.48, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "The warning signs have been there.", "start": 176.72, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "The question is whether our attention", "start": 180.16, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "lasts long enough to act.", "start": 183.2, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "and what we neglect", "start": 187.04, "duration": 7.199}, {"text": "has a habit of shaping our future.", "start": 189.36, "duration": 6.959}, {"text": "Your excellencies,", "start": 194.239, "duration": 4.801}, {"text": "we see the cost of that neglect every", "start": 196.319, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "day.", "start": 199.04, "duration": 4.479}, {"text": "In my region, from Lebanon to Yemen to", "start": 200.959, "duration": 7.041}, {"text": "Sudan, protracted conflict is deepening", "start": 203.519, "duration": 6.881}, {"text": "humanitarian suffering.", "start": 208.0, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "And if anyone had any doubt that a", "start": 210.4, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "crisis in our part of the world stays", "start": 213.84, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "there,", "start": 216.72, "duration": 3.84}, {"text": "just look at the energy and grocery", "start": 218.72, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "bills of ordinary families from Mumbai", "start": 220.56, "duration": 8.16}, {"text": "to Madrid to Minnesota.", "start": 224.56, "duration": 6.959}, {"text": "The Iran war has shown how quickly", "start": 228.72, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "instability can disrupt trade,", "start": 231.519, "duration": 7.841}, {"text": "investment, and lives beyond the region.", "start": 234.0, "duration": 9.28}, {"text": "And then there is Gaza.", "start": 239.36, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "For decades, I've stood before this", "start": 243.28, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "assembly and warned of the dangers of", "start": 245.12, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "leaving the Palestinian Israeli conflict", "start": 248.4, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "unresolved.", "start": 251.84, "duration": 5.679}, {"text": "But the international community", "start": 254.48, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "chose to manage the conflict, not", "start": 257.519, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "confront it.", "start": 259.84, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "And every new Israeli violation was", "start": 262.479, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "treated as temporary,", "start": 265.44, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "diverting attention from the reality", "start": 268.479, "duration": 6.881}, {"text": "being created on the ground", "start": 271.36, "duration": 8.16}, {"text": "until temporary became permanent", "start": 275.36, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "and permanent", "start": 279.52, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "became policy.", "start": 281.44, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "Of course, this is not the world's only", "start": 284.24, "duration": 3.84}, {"text": "injustice,", "start": 286.4, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "but one of the world's longest running", "start": 288.08, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "occupations", "start": 290.8, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "forces a basic question.", "start": 292.4, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "If international law can be ignored for", "start": 295.36, "duration": 4.16}, {"text": "decades,", "start": 297.84, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "then what exactly is that law worth?", "start": 299.52, "duration": 7.84}, {"text": "And how can we enforce it if we won't", "start": 303.28, "duration": 9.0}, {"text": "even call out its violations?", "start": 307.36, "duration": 4.92}, {"text": "In Gaza, the evidence is overwhelming.", "start": 312.4, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "In the first 300 days of the so-called", "start": 315.36, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "ceasefire, at least 300 Palestinian", "start": 318.0, "duration": 6.639}, {"text": "children were killed.", "start": 321.36, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "Jordan's field hospitals have also been", "start": 324.639, "duration": 5.201}, {"text": "targeted.", "start": 327.28, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "President Trump has pushed hard for", "start": 329.84, "duration": 7.84}, {"text": "peace and a path to end this war.", "start": 332.8, "duration": 7.6}, {"text": "But this Israeli government", "start": 337.68, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "keeps moving the goalposts, continuing", "start": 340.4, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "its attacks and destruction of civilian", "start": 342.72, "duration": 5.759}, {"text": "infrastructure, refusing to withdraw,", "start": 345.6, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "and squeezing Palestinians into barely a", "start": 348.479, "duration": 7.361}, {"text": "third of Gazda.", "start": 352.0, "duration": 6.479}, {"text": "This can no longer be dismissed as", "start": 355.84, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "temporary military measures or a", "start": 358.479, "duration": 7.121}, {"text": "consequence of war.", "start": 362.32, "duration": 5.599}, {"text": "Accountability begins when we call", "start": 365.6, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "things for what they are. An attempt to", "start": 367.919, "duration": 6.481}, {"text": "erase Palestinian life and impose a new", "start": 371.28, "duration": 7.44}, {"text": "territorial reality in Gaza.", "start": 374.4, "duration": 7.04}, {"text": "And while the world has been focused on", "start": 378.72, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "Raza,", "start": 381.44, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "something extraordinarily dangerous", "start": 383.68, "duration": 7.04}, {"text": "is unfolding in the West Bank.", "start": 386.72, "duration": 7.52}, {"text": "Some may think we have seen this before.", "start": 390.72, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "Settlements, violence, displacement,", "start": 394.24, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "more of the same,", "start": 396.8, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "but it is not.", "start": 399.52, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "Nor is it simply an escalation.", "start": 402.0, "duration": 7.68}, {"text": "This is a fundamental shift.", "start": 406.0, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "What was once a creeping process has", "start": 409.68, "duration": 4.959}, {"text": "exploded into something far more", "start": 412.88, "duration": 3.84}, {"text": "aggressive.", "start": 414.639, "duration": 3.441}, {"text": "Settler violence is rampant.", "start": 416.72, "duration": 3.759}, {"text": "Palestinians are being beaten, shot, and", "start": 418.08, "duration": 4.08}, {"text": "terrorized,", "start": 420.479, "duration": 3.361}, {"text": "homeschurched,", "start": 422.16, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "property destroyed, families driven from", "start": 423.84, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "their land.", "start": 426.4, "duration": 5.199}, {"text": "And Israel is tightening its grip on", "start": 428.88, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "more of the West Bank, seizing land,", "start": 431.599, "duration": 5.361}, {"text": "expanding settlements,", "start": 434.88, "duration": 6.879}, {"text": "and pushing the Palestinians out.", "start": 436.96, "duration": 8.16}, {"text": "It is time to see what is happening for", "start": 441.759, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "what it really is.", "start": 445.12, "duration": 4.639}, {"text": "Because when the language is sanitized,", "start": 447.599, "duration": 6.241}, {"text": "the actions become normalized.", "start": 449.759, "duration": 6.801}, {"text": "Demolishing Palestinian homes to expand", "start": 453.84, "duration": 5.759}, {"text": "illegal settlements is not law", "start": 456.56, "duration": 5.199}, {"text": "enforcement.", "start": 459.599, "duration": 5.281}, {"text": "It is forcible transfer.", "start": 461.759, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "Appropriating occupied land is not land", "start": 464.88, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "registration.", "start": 467.919, "duration": 6.241}, {"text": "It is de facto annexation.", "start": 470.0, "duration": 6.879}, {"text": "A choking network of checkpoints and", "start": 474.16, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "barriers", "start": 476.879, "duration": 5.521}, {"text": "is not security infrastructure.", "start": 478.4, "duration": 8.4}, {"text": "It is a system of subjugation.", "start": 482.4, "duration": 6.079}, {"text": "Systematic attacks on Palestinian", "start": 486.8, "duration": 3.76}, {"text": "communities", "start": 488.479, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "are not settler unrest.", "start": 490.56, "duration": 6.479}, {"text": "The Israeli government criticizes the", "start": 494.319, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "violence before the international", "start": 497.039, "duration": 3.6}, {"text": "audiences.", "start": 498.879, "duration": 4.481}, {"text": "They call those responsible a handful of", "start": 500.639, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "riers.", "start": 503.36, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "They assure us that Israel is a country", "start": 505.199, "duration": 6.081}, {"text": "governed by law.", "start": 508.56, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "Yet what's happening on the ground says", "start": 511.28, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "otherwise.", "start": 514.08, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "Israeli soldiers stand by as settlers", "start": 516.56, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "attack Palestinians, often protecting", "start": 518.8, "duration": 6.719}, {"text": "the attackers or joining them.", "start": 521.36, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "They have blocked ambulances from", "start": 525.519, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "reaching the injured.", "start": 527.76, "duration": 3.519}, {"text": "They have targeted international", "start": 529.839, "duration": 4.641}, {"text": "journalists who are trying to say the", "start": 531.279, "duration": 5.601}, {"text": "truth.", "start": 534.48, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "And when soldiers watch,", "start": 536.88, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "enable, and sometimes even participate", "start": 539.6, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "in violence against civilians,", "start": 542.0, "duration": 7.839}, {"text": "this is no longer about a handful of", "start": 546.32, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "rioters.", "start": 549.839, "duration": 5.841}, {"text": "And the question is no longer whether a", "start": 552.0, "duration": 7.04}, {"text": "few extremists are breaking the law.", "start": 555.68, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "The question is,", "start": 559.04, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "is this the behavior of a democratic", "start": 561.6, "duration": 7.2}, {"text": "state governed by law?", "start": 564.24, "duration": 7.68}, {"text": "What is unfolding across the West Bank", "start": 568.8, "duration": 6.8}, {"text": "is not a series of isolated acts.", "start": 571.92, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "It is elements of a single policy to", "start": 575.6, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "compel an entire population", "start": 578.64, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "to leave their land.", "start": 581.36, "duration": 6.479}, {"text": "And there is a name for that.", "start": 584.88, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "forced displacement", "start": 587.839, "duration": 7.801}, {"text": "and that is a war crime.", "start": 590.48, "duration": 5.16}, {"text": "Your excellencies,", "start": 596.0, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "if we are to resolve the Palestinian", "start": 598.0, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "Israeli conflict,", "start": 601.36, "duration": 7.52}, {"text": "the world must abandon some illusions.", "start": 603.92, "duration": 8.72}, {"text": "The first is that Gaza and the West Bank", "start": 608.88, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "are separate stories.", "start": 612.64, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "They are not.", "start": 614.8, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "They are two fronts of the same Israeli", "start": 617.2, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "strategy.", "start": 620.16, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "In both, Palestinians", "start": 622.32, "duration": 7.28}, {"text": "are being killed. In both, the reality", "start": 625.68, "duration": 7.36}, {"text": "on the ground is being remade.", "start": 629.6, "duration": 5.679}, {"text": "Gaza through destruction,", "start": 633.04, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "the West Bank through de facto", "start": 635.279, "duration": 5.921}, {"text": "annexation.", "start": 638.32, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "The objective is the same. to make a", "start": 641.2, "duration": 9.24}, {"text": "viable Palestinian state impossible.", "start": 645.04, "duration": 5.4}, {"text": "Another illusion is that this Israeli", "start": 650.48, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "leadership's rejection of Palestinian", "start": 653.36, "duration": 6.96}, {"text": "statethood is a position that might yet", "start": 656.0, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "change.", "start": 660.32, "duration": 3.92}, {"text": "It is not.", "start": 662.24, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "It is cemented on the ground.", "start": 664.24, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "This government has been accelerating", "start": 667.76, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "settlements and land seizures,", "start": 670.0, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "but it began long before.", "start": 673.04, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "Since Oslo, the map has changed piece by", "start": 676.64, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "piece, settlement by settlement.", "start": 679.6, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "And the most dangerous illusion", "start": 683.12, "duration": 8.24}, {"text": "that the Arab world never sought peace.", "start": 686.16, "duration": 10.16}, {"text": "The Arab Peace Initiative of 2002", "start": 691.36, "duration": 9.44}, {"text": "offered Israel normalization with 57", "start": 696.32, "duration": 8.32}, {"text": "Arab and Muslim states including Iran", "start": 700.8, "duration": 8.8}, {"text": "and Iraq at the time in exchange for", "start": 704.64, "duration": 9.92}, {"text": "peace and Palestinian statethood.", "start": 709.6, "duration": 7.44}, {"text": "For over 20 years,", "start": 714.56, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "that offer has stood.", "start": 717.04, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "The obstacle hasn't been the absence of", "start": 720.8, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "a partner for peace,", "start": 723.76, "duration": 6.079}, {"text": "but the absence of an Israeli government", "start": 726.48, "duration": 7.44}, {"text": "willing to accept it.", "start": 729.839, "duration": 7.8}, {"text": "This Israeli government,", "start": 733.92, "duration": 3.719}, {"text": "this Israeli government understands the", "start": 743.36, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "power of attention.", "start": 745.44, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "And lately, it has not liked the", "start": 748.56, "duration": 6.079}, {"text": "attention it's been getting.", "start": 751.2, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "When confronted with evidence of", "start": 754.639, "duration": 3.44}, {"text": "wrongdoing,", "start": 756.56, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "rather than change the course, it opts", "start": 758.079, "duration": 6.241}, {"text": "for distraction, discrediting its", "start": 761.12, "duration": 5.279}, {"text": "critics.", "start": 764.32, "duration": 6.079}, {"text": "It has also tried to cast this conflict", "start": 766.399, "duration": 6.481}, {"text": "as a war of religions.", "start": 770.399, "duration": 5.041}, {"text": "Islam on one side, Judaism and", "start": 772.88, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "Christianity on the other.", "start": 775.44, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "It is not.", "start": 779.04, "duration": 4.479}, {"text": "This is about whether Palestinians,", "start": 781.2, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "Muslims, and Christians are entitled to", "start": 783.519, "duration": 7.801}, {"text": "the same rights as everyone else.", "start": 786.24, "duration": 5.08}, {"text": "Distractions will not fly anymore.", "start": 798.16, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "People across the world are paying", "start": 801.36, "duration": 4.08}, {"text": "attention.", "start": 803.6, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "The question now is will we act", "start": 805.44, "duration": 7.76}, {"text": "because the world's political inaction", "start": 809.92, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "is not for lack of options.", "start": 813.2, "duration": 6.96}, {"text": "So let's call it for what it is.", "start": 816.48, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "A choice.", "start": 820.16, "duration": 4.08}, {"text": "We have tools.", "start": 822.24, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "Sanctions, asset freezes, embargos,", "start": 824.24, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "diplomatic isolation,", "start": 826.88, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "and we have a record of using them", "start": 829.2, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "elsewhere.", "start": 832.48, "duration": 4.719}, {"text": "Yet with Israel,", "start": 834.8, "duration": 6.399}, {"text": "resolutions end where they began", "start": 837.199, "duration": 7.32}, {"text": "on paper.", "start": 841.199, "duration": 3.32}, {"text": "This result", "start": 848.16, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "is a state without restraint. This", "start": 850.16, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "government's sense of impunity has", "start": 853.44, "duration": 5.519}, {"text": "reached terrifying levels.", "start": 855.92, "duration": 5.599}, {"text": "It no longer feels compelled to ask,", "start": 858.959, "duration": 5.201}, {"text": "\"Can we get away with this?\"", "start": 861.519, "duration": 5.601}, {"text": "It already knows the answer.", "start": 864.16, "duration": 6.239}, {"text": "And that is precisely why no one in this", "start": 867.12, "duration": 7.76}, {"text": "assembly should assume its ambition stop", "start": 870.399, "duration": 7.8}, {"text": "at Palestine.", "start": 874.88, "duration": 3.319}, {"text": "This Israeli government's expansionist", "start": 878.24, "duration": 3.599}, {"text": "appetite", "start": 880.24, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "is now a regional threat.", "start": 881.839, "duration": 6.081}, {"text": "And today,", "start": 885.68, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "Syria is the warning the international", "start": 887.92, "duration": 6.8}, {"text": "community is choosing not to see.", "start": 890.56, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "Repeated incursions, creeping", "start": 894.72, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "territorial expansion, new facts imposed", "start": 896.56, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "on the ground, including around vital", "start": 899.68, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "water resources.", "start": 902.48, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "Step by calculated step, Israel is", "start": 905.36, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "testing how far it can go.", "start": 907.92, "duration": 5.359}, {"text": "And every time the international", "start": 911.6, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "community looks away,", "start": 913.279, "duration": 6.401}, {"text": "Israel learns that it can go even", "start": 916.88, "duration": 6.639}, {"text": "further across border lines and legal", "start": 919.68, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "limits.", "start": 923.519, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "For Jordan,", "start": 925.92, "duration": 5.039}, {"text": "there is no ambiguity.", "start": 927.839, "duration": 6.8}, {"text": "Any threat to our northern border or our", "start": 930.959, "duration": 5.921}, {"text": "water security", "start": 934.639, "duration": 7.521}, {"text": "is a threat to our national security.", "start": 936.88, "duration": 8.48}, {"text": "Jordan will not look away. We will", "start": 942.16, "duration": 7.28}, {"text": "protect our security, our water, and the", "start": 945.36, "duration": 7.839}, {"text": "interests of our people.", "start": 949.44, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "And the question here is,", "start": 953.199, "duration": 6.161}, {"text": "if Israel continues its antagonistic", "start": 956.32, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "approach in southern Syria,", "start": 959.36, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "will the international community stand", "start": 962.24, "duration": 3.44}, {"text": "by", "start": 964.16, "duration": 5.239}, {"text": "and let that happen?", "start": 965.68, "duration": 3.719}, {"text": "Your excellencies,", "start": 970.24, "duration": 3.76}, {"text": "some things demand our immediate", "start": 972.56, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "attention, others demand sustained", "start": 974.0, "duration": 4.079}, {"text": "attention.", "start": 976.56, "duration": 5.199}, {"text": "Injustice demands both.", "start": 978.079, "duration": 7.281}, {"text": "Jordan understands this all too well.", "start": 981.759, "duration": 5.841}, {"text": "We know what it means to live in a", "start": 985.36, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "region where one crisis arrives before", "start": 987.6, "duration": 5.679}, {"text": "the last one has receded.", "start": 990.72, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "And we know that we cannot choose", "start": 993.279, "duration": 4.881}, {"text": "between responding to the emergency", "start": 996.0, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "before us and building the future beyond", "start": 998.16, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "it.", "start": 1002.16, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "So we're doing both. We are", "start": 1003.68, "duration": 4.959}, {"text": "strengthening connections from the Gulf", "start": 1006.16, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "to the Mediterranean as a hub for trade,", "start": 1008.639, "duration": 5.681}, {"text": "industry, and technology", "start": 1011.6, "duration": 6.239}, {"text": "while responding to humanitarian crisis.", "start": 1014.32, "duration": 5.759}, {"text": "We are confronting terrorism in the", "start": 1017.839, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "region and beyond.", "start": 1020.079, "duration": 5.041}, {"text": "While developing our own defenses and", "start": 1022.399, "duration": 6.001}, {"text": "remaining a front line against threats", "start": 1025.12, "duration": 5.839}, {"text": "like dichotics,", "start": 1028.4, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "we are protecting Christianity in its", "start": 1030.959, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "communities and heritage in its native", "start": 1033.36, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "and historic land", "start": 1036.079, "duration": 6.561}, {"text": "while promoting the true image of Islam", "start": 1038.48, "duration": 8.76}, {"text": "against the voices of hate.", "start": 1042.64, "duration": 4.6}, {"text": "And through it all,", "start": 1051.84, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "we will not abandon our commitment to a", "start": 1054.24, "duration": 7.28}, {"text": "just peace. We will continue to support", "start": 1058.16, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "Palestinian resilience. We will continue", "start": 1061.52, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "supporting Anroa and we will continue to", "start": 1064.0, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "uphold the hashmite custodianship and", "start": 1066.88, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "historic and legal status quo at Muslim", "start": 1070.0, "duration": 8.6}, {"text": "and Christian holy sites in Jerusalem.", "start": 1073.76, "duration": 4.84}, {"text": "Most importantly, Jordan is striving to", "start": 1082.799, "duration": 5.921}, {"text": "build a different model, principled,", "start": 1085.36, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "open, and steady.", "start": 1088.72, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "At a time when certainty is rare, and", "start": 1092.08, "duration": 6.8}, {"text": "politics can shift by the day,", "start": 1095.2, "duration": 7.52}, {"text": "a country the world can count on. true", "start": 1098.88, "duration": 7.12}, {"text": "to our principles, true to our word,", "start": 1102.72, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "ready to talk to everyone, and ready to", "start": 1106.0, "duration": 8.72}, {"text": "work with anyone seeking peace.", "start": 1109.36, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "However,", "start": 1114.72, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "our bias towards diplomacy will never", "start": 1116.24, "duration": 6.559}, {"text": "supersede our commitment to human values", "start": 1119.28, "duration": 7.04}, {"text": "and should not be taken for granted or", "start": 1122.799, "duration": 8.12}, {"text": "mistaken for weakness.", "start": 1126.32, "duration": 4.599}, {"text": "My friends, whether in Gaza, Sudan,", "start": 1135.919, "duration": 5.441}, {"text": "Ukraine, or anywhere, people live with", "start": 1138.559, "duration": 7.281}, {"text": "war, displacement, and fear. Whether", "start": 1141.36, "duration": 7.199}, {"text": "crisis began weeks ago or has endured", "start": 1145.84, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "for decades,", "start": 1148.559, "duration": 4.721}, {"text": "our principles cannot change with the", "start": 1150.24, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "world's attention.", "start": 1153.28, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "Military force cannot deliver meaningful", "start": 1155.52, "duration": 6.159}, {"text": "solutions. It cannot feed the hungry,", "start": 1158.48, "duration": 6.8}, {"text": "return the displaced, or build peace.", "start": 1161.679, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "Nor can it repair our planet, manage", "start": 1165.28, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "mass migration, or guide technological", "start": 1168.559, "duration": 4.721}, {"text": "progress.", "start": 1171.52, "duration": 3.92}, {"text": "That requires institutions that command", "start": 1173.28, "duration": 3.92}, {"text": "legitimacy.", "start": 1175.44, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "And it requires trust.", "start": 1177.2, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "Trust between nations, trust in", "start": 1180.08, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "agreements, trust that rules will", "start": 1182.16, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "actually be enforced.", "start": 1185.52, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "Destroy that trust", "start": 1188.24, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "and every challenge becomes harder.", "start": 1190.48, "duration": 7.199}, {"text": "Preserve it and cooperation becomes", "start": 1194.4, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "possible. And in a world competing for", "start": 1197.679, "duration": 4.961}, {"text": "our attention,", "start": 1200.96, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "we must be deliberate about where we", "start": 1202.64, "duration": 6.159}, {"text": "direct it and vigilant about what seeks", "start": 1205.2, "duration": 5.839}, {"text": "to distract it.", "start": 1208.799, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "The future is shaped not only by what we", "start": 1211.039, "duration": 8.0}, {"text": "do, but what we choose to ignore.", "start": 1213.919, "duration": 8.361}, {"text": "Thank you.", "start": 1219.039, "duration": 3.241}, {"text": ">> On on behalf of the assembly, I wish to", "start": 1225.2, "duration": 7.599}, {"text": "thank the king of the Hashemid Kingdom", "start": 1230.0, "duration": 6.2}, {"text": "of Jordan.", "start": 1232.799, "duration": 3.401}]